ce, across launches. An instance ID isn’t a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"secret — every request naming it is signed with the registration key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— but losing it loses the instance: the wallet then registers again,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with a new registration key and App Attest key, and the instance keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the lost instance recorded can’t be attested again."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileInstanceRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps it in a file;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryInstanceRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":" is for tests. Over either, every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" in the process registering or asserting for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same registration takes turns; over a registry of another type,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a provider takes turns only with itself: keep one provider for it."}],"title":"InstanceRegistry","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"InstanceRegistry"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"InstanceRegistry"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InstanceRegistry","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/FileInstanceRegistry":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileInstanceRegistry","title":"FileInstanceRegistry","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InstanceRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":" in a JSON file ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileInstanceRegistry\/url"},{"type":"text","text":"), written whole and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"atomically, so a reader never sees part of it, and kept out of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"backups: a restored instance ID is useless without its registration"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key and App Attest key, which never leave this device. Keep one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wallet process writing it. Every "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" over a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registry in the same file, in this process, shares its locks, so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registers once and makes its assertions in order however many"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"providers the app makes."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FileInstanceRegistry","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/fileinstanceregistry","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FileInstanceRegistry","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"title":"OID4VCWallet","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP